==Trivia==
[[File:TCGP Cover Garden of Smiling Flowers.png|thumb|"Garden of Smiling Flowers" binder cover]]
This card's {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} illustration is part of a {{TCG|combined illustration}} along with {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Tangela|4}}, {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Shaymin|22}}, and {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Buneary|137}} from the same expansion. Together, these cards form the Space-Time Smackdown expansion's "Garden of Smiling Flowers" [[Space-Time Smackdown (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]]. A second collection—the "Garden of Smiling Flowers 2" secret mission—was added to the game on June 26, 2025; the completion reward for this is the "Garden of Smiling Flowers" binder cover, showcasing the full illustration.

===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Neo Genesis|Togepi|51}} from the {{TCG|Neo Genesis}} expansion.
*{{m|Pound}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Togepi}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

